+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured cost of the `SessionStart` health gate (`muninn-core/src/health.rs`), p50, on a
+5,000-record store:
+
+| When | p50 | Change |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Before | 11.9 ms | `PRAGMA quick_check` ran on the `SessionStart` read path |
+| After | 1.05 ms | `quick_check` taken off the read path (deferred to session end, result cached via `quick_check_at`/`quick_check_result` in `meta`, see `Db::record_quick_check` in `crates/muninn-core/src/db.rs`), plus the `fts_rows` counter and the `body` `CHECK` constraint added in the same change |
+
+These two numbers come from a prior session's measurement recorded in project history; they are
+not currently duplicated anywhere else in this repo's own docs or benchmark output, so they
+could not be cross-checked against a second source here. No fresher measurement was taken for
+this entry — if that matters, re-run the `SessionStart` hook benchmark against a 5k-record store
+and replace these numbers rather than adjusting them by hand.
